WEBVTT

00:05:58.913 --> 00:06:00.954
Ok, sad začepite taj flomaster

00:06:01.038 --> 00:06:02.621
i iz šalice izaberite novi

00:06:03.204 --> 00:06:05.329
i obojite mi pijetla, obojite pijetla.

00:06:06.996 --> 00:06:09.079
Dobro, dobro, dobro,
široki potezi, dobro.

00:06:09.204 --> 00:06:10.913
Iz šalice izaberite novi flomaster

00:06:11.621 --> 00:06:14.121
i obojite mi vola, obojite vola.

00:06:14.704 --> 00:06:15.704
Ok, dobro.

00:06:16.079 --> 00:06:18.454
Stavite puno boje, začepite,
vratite na stol

00:06:18.788 --> 00:06:20.663
i izaberite novi flomaster iz šalice.

00:06:21.746 --> 00:06:22.788
Oh, nemam više?

00:06:22.788 --> 00:06:23.829
Okrećem se.

00:06:23.871 --> 00:06:25.121
Jesam li što zaboravio?

00:06:25.371 --> 00:06:27.538
Zaboravio sam svoj ljubičasti flomaster.

00:06:29.288 --> 00:06:32.371
Svejedno, mislim,
uglavnom će funkcionirati.